    "Jagadrix 7 stars, Dawnseeker and Antares 5 stars, Vermithor 3 stars, and Shimmer Loyal Shield level 4 supersede their older directly verified profile/overlay values. The screenshots do not establish when those upgrades occurred.",
    "Latest directly observed habit levels in this overlay take precedence over older habit snapshots for these twenty dragons; retain older upgrade cost/effect references as dated evidence. No commander or march changes were supplied.",
    "IMG_5911–IMG_5920 extend the same dated overlay to twenty directly observed profiles. Vaeldra's third habit is Tempting Distraction (dragons/vaeldra.json). Sunfyre's first unlocked habit is level 1; its name is unverified and retained as null rather than inferred from artwork. Other habit and command names are matched to prior roster evidence. No exact upgrade timing or full ownership census inferred."
